#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32F0 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32F0 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (F030, F031, F042, F051, F070, F072, F091, F098)
